# fable5-gpt5.6-judged — the cross-family-judging harness (same as /fusion-gpt5.6).
#
# SUPERSEDED by fable5-astra-judged (September 2026). Preserved here, frozen with its original model strings
# (gpt-5.6-sol), so the GPT-5.6 Sol era stays one env var away. Select it with FUSION_VARIANT=<this file's name>.
#
# Same cross-model panel as fable5-gpt5.6 (Fable 5.1 + GPT-5.6 Sol), but GPT-5.6 Sol (codex) does the discernment
# instead of a blind Fable subprocess — the adjudicator is a different model family than the synthesizer.
# Requires the codex CLI; run_judge.sh falls back to the Fable judge per SKILL.md if it's missing.
: "${FUSION_PANEL:=fable5,gpt5.6}"
: "${FUSION_JUDGE:=gpt5.6}"
: "${FUSION_CLAUDE_MODEL:=claude-fable-5-1}"
: "${FUSION_OPUS_MODEL:=opus}"
: "${CODEX_PANELIST_MODEL:=gpt-5.6-sol}"
: "${JUDGE_MODEL:=gpt-5.6-sol}"
